d vulnerability (buildings, defences, preparedness), which decide whether a hazard becomes a disaster."},"source":{"name":"NASA POWER (Prediction Of Worldwide Energy Resources), NASA Langley Research Center","url":"https://power.larc.nasa.gov/","cite":"Precipitation: PRECTOTCORR (IMERG-corrected MERRA-2). Temperature: T2M (MERRA-2). Climatology: January 2001 – December 2025."},"computedAt":"2026-11-13T05:19:07.155Z","snapshotAt":"2026-11-13T05:19:07.156Z"}